/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/redteam/codex_reviews/stage_112.md.raw:802:/var/projects/toy_physics/research/pde_ledger/notes/MATHEMATICA_MIRROR_POLICY.md:407:  `Delta = Lambda L^2 sigma_0 / (2 T_X)` in the `K_m -> infty` limit.
